    "answer": {
      "short": "a $21\\text{ cm}^2$; b $6\\text{ cm}$; c $10\\text{ m}$; d $24\\text{ km}$.",
      "worked": "a\n$$\\begin{align*}A&=\\tfrac12 bh\\\\A&=\\tfrac12\\times7\\times6\\\\A&=21\\text{ cm}^2\\end{align*}$$\nb\n$$\\begin{align*}27&=\\tfrac12\\times9\\times h\\\\h&=27\\times2\\div9\\\\h&=6\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$\nc\n$$\\begin{align*}85&=\\tfrac12\\times b\\times17\\\\b&=85\\times2\\div17\\\\b&=10\\text{ m}\\end{align*}$$\nd\n$$\\begin{align*}144&=\\tfrac12\\times12\\times h\\\\h&=144\\times2\\div12\\\\h&=24\\text{ km}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
